<title>USA: Oakley shares recover some in early trading.</title>
<headline>Oakley shares recover some in early trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakley Inc shares jumped in early trading on Friday after the sunglass maker said it expected third quarter profits to beat analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>The shares rose one to 19-5/8 after a two-for-one stock split went into effect.</p>
